@host = http://localhost:5250

### Part 1: invalid product -> 400 (checkpoint: paste this body)
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "", "sku": "", "price": -5 }

### Part 2: custom rule (SalePrice >= Price) -> 400 "SalePrice must be less than Price."
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Keyboard", "sku": "KEY-001", "price": 10, "salePrice": 20 }

### Part 4: valid product -> 201 + Location header (checkpoint)
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Keyboard", "sku": "KEY-001", "price": 60, "salePrice": 50 }

### Add two more so paging has something to show
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mouse", "sku": "MOU-001", "price": 25 }

###
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Monitor", "sku": "MON-001", "price": 330 }

### Duplicate SKU (case-insensitive) -> 409 Conflict
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Another Keyboard", "sku": "key-001", "price": 60 }

### Part 3/4: missing id -> 404 Problem Details (checkpoint; also copy the server log line)
GET {{host}}/api/products/9999

### Part 4: paged list -> 200 { data, meta } (checkpoint)
GET {{host}}/api/products?page=1&pageSize=2

### Bad paging -> 400
GET {{host}}/api/products?page=0&pageSize=500

### Update -> 200
PUT {{host}}/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Keyboard Pro", "sku": "KEY-001", "price": 80 }

### Custom rule must ALSO work on PUT -> 400
PUT {{host}}/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Keyboard Pro", "sku": "KEY-001", "price": 80, "salePrice": 90 }

### Delete -> 204 (no body)
DELETE {{host}}/api/products/3

### Unknown route -> 404 Problem Details (thanks to UseStatusCodePages)
GET {{host}}/api/nothing-here

### To see a 500: temporarily add `throw new Exception("boom");` at the top of GetAll in the
### service, call the list endpoint, and confirm the client gets NO stack trace while the
### terminal log shows the full one. Remove the line afterwards.
